# API Configuration - Choose one provider below

# Option 1: OpenRouter.ai (recommended for cost savings)
# Get your API key from: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Uncomment the line below and add your OpenRouter API key
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-openrouter-key-here
# API_PROVIDER=openrouter

# Option 2: Anthropic Console (direct access)
# Get your API key from: https://console.anthropic.com
# Uncomment the line below and add your Anthropic API key
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-anthropic-key-here
# API_PROVIDER=anthropic
